{
    "title": "Taxi Games: Taxi Driving Games",
    "description": "Taxi Games: Taxi Driving Games with the updated version is out now, featuring a lot of reality-based elements of taxi car games. The real taxi game allows gamers to experience the city tour as a taxi driver. So, are you ready to enjoy the most fascinating taxi simulator games offline? Let\u2019s enjoy and explore the beautiful city with the taxi driving simulator, where you have to pick up and drop off passengers at targeted locations to complete the levels of the taxi games simulator. Taxi driver games offline provide the most interesting and easy-to-use controls, making the 3D taxi driving game lovelier to play.\r\n\r\nTaxi Games: Taxi Driving Games Features:\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude97 High-quality ultra 3D graphics for taxi car games\r\n\ud83d\ude97 Large city environment for taxi driver games\r\n\ud83d\ude97 Dispatch calls to pick up passengers in taxi simulator games\r\n\ud83d\ude97 Traffic signals to react like a real taxi game\r\n\ud83d\ude97 Detailed maps for the taxi driving simulator\r\n\ud83d\ude97 Four game modes of taxi driving games\r\n\ud83d\ude97 Refueling system for the taxi game\r\n\ud83d\ude97 Unlimited customers like real taxi games\r\n\ud83d\ude97 Flying car mode to enjoy rides in the atmosphere\r\n\r\nPick and drop passengers to earn money in taxi simulator games\r\n\r\nTaxi Games: Taxi Driving Games is full of fun, offering a \u201cpick and drop\u201d facility all over the city. Besides fun, taxi car games are totally challenging to play, and you have to keep checking your fuel tank because you need to refill after a certain journey in the real taxi driving game offline. If you have gotten bored of typical racing games and want to become a taxi driver by playing a taxi driving simulator, then you must try taxi driver games.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the realistic and real-life driving with real taxi driver games\r\n\r\nIf you are crazy about playing Taxi Games: Taxi Driving Games, then you are in the right place. Just play and enjoy taxi simulator games offline. Being a taxi driver in the game is all about searching for passengers and earning game money, which is really challenging in the real taxi games simulator. Different kinds and different color-themed vehicles are available in taxi simulator games offline, so just go to the garage and choose your favorite taxi car. Currently, the taxi driving simulator offers different modes:\r\n\u2022 Career mode\r\n\u2022 Open world mode\r\n\u2022 Flying mode\r\n\u2022 Rickshaw mode\r\n\r\nFly high in the sky above the city with taxi simulator games\r\n\r\nThe flying mode of Taxi Games: Taxi Driving Games allows you to not only drive your car but also fly it like an airplane. Enjoy real taxi car games and fly high in the sky above the city. Explore the beauty of the city by flying high with taxi games. If you want to be a real pilot, then the taxi driving game is going to be real fun for you. Picking up and dropping off passengers in the taxi games simulator by flying above the buildings is a real satisfaction and a chance to earn more golden coins in real taxi driver games.\r\n\r\nTaxi Games: Taxi Driving Games offers an amazing playing screen with intuitive controls and play buttons, making the taxi driving game more addictive. The music play button allows you to play different built-in songs available in taxi games. Two different view perspectives give you an opportunity to experience the beauty of the city in the taxi driving simulator. This taxi driving game comes with smooth controls but challenging and hard-to-complete 3D levels.\r\n\r\nFunsol Gaming presents Taxi Driving Game - Taxi Games with action-packed and amusing features that make users feel the real taxi simulator games.",
